---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Trailmike is a personal journal. Trip notes and tech build notes are shared as-is — use your own judgment."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap disclaimer">
      <p class="eyebrow fade-up">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="fade-up-delay">Disclaimer</h1>
      <div class="prose fade-up-delay-2">
        <p>
          trailmike.com is a personal journal: backpacking trip notes and edge AI / homelab build
          notes. Content is for general informational and educational purposes. By using this site,
          you agree you’re responsible for your own safety, hardware, data, and decisions.
        </p>

        <h2>Accuracy</h2>
        <p>
          Everything here reflects personal experience at the time it was written. Conditions,
          software versions, trail status, and best practices change. No guarantee is made that
          any page is complete, current, or error-free.
        </p>

        <h2>Outdoors</h2>
        <p>
          Backpacking and wilderness travel involve real risk — weather, injury, wildlife, navigation
          errors, and changing trail conditions among them. Route notes and trip write-ups describe
          past personal trips, not instructions that guarantee a safe outcome. You are responsible
          for your fitness, skills, gear, permits, and for checking current conditions, closures, and
          forecasts before you go.
        </p>

        <h2>Tech and edge AI</h2>
        <p>
          Homelab and edge AI notes — Jetson bring-up, containers, configs, commands, pipelines —
          are shared as-is for hobbyist and learning use. Running similar setups can mean hardware
          damage, outages, or data loss. Back up what matters, secure your own network, and verify
          anything before you run it on your machines. Nothing here is professional consulting or
          certified IT advice.
        </p>

        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>
          Links to other sites are provided for convenience. Their content and practices are outside
          this site’s control.
        </p>

        <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
        <p>
          Some links on trailmike.com may be affiliate links. If you click one and buy something, a
          small commission may be earned at no extra cost to you. Recommendations are based on
          personal use — what actually got carried, worn, or plugged in — not on who pays more.
          Affiliate links will be marked where they appear (not only on this page).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .disclaimer {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 3.8rem);
  }

  .prose {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .prose p,
  .prose li {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0.65rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--stone);
  }
</style>
